# Beyond assets/source/.gitignore: what the scripts here make again, for the three weapon assets (bows/, firearms/,
# thrown/) and their shared kit.
__pycache__/
*.blend1
# The image model's run logs; its briefs, reports, last messages and timings are kept.
artist-transcript*.txt
# The materials are used at 1,024 (materials.ts); their 2,048 sets, their construction fields and diagnostics, and their
# first passes are rebuilt by build_material.py, and the steel's packed map as made beside the tuned one by
# tune_steel.py. Both materials are made by script alone: no picture of the image tool's is in either.
*/tex/*/*_base.png
*/tex/*/*_height.png
*/tex/*/*_normal.png
*/tex/*/*_orm.png
*/tex/*/*_orm_made*.png
*/tex/*/source/*.png
*/tex/*/source/pass1/
# The concepts' raw renders, which their scripts make again from the masters kept beside them.
*/ref/concept/renders/
# The game's pictures as snap.ts writes them; the ones kept are under ref/game/, as JPEG.
ref/*.png
